<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy says will not renew Oct 16 mark repo.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy says will not renew Oct 16 mark repo.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said in a statement on Friday it would not renew the mark repo tender due next Wednesday, October 16, for liquidity reasons.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66101174</p>
</text>
